# The jet scooter (Obj_JetScooter, ps2.asm:6767) into a dam. The save is
# slot 1 on Motavia at 89,116 with $C716 = 1 and the scooter parked where
# loc_E690 leaves it, $590,$730: on the water just above, outside Roron.
#
# A on it is ObjType_Events 6 (loc_DAA4): $C716 goes 1 -> 2, so the note
# the Mota people left ($1686) plays before $171C, "Let's get on the jet
# scooter!". The next idle visit sets jet_scooter_flag; the party hides
# and the scooter's init switches to loc_29E16 and its main routine.
# It steps 16px in 8 frames and probes two cells ahead a direction; the
# dam entrances are solid and special in its table only, so the push up
# from $510,$520 reaches Motavia's record 81,81 through loc_6E4E: Red Dam
# F1 at 47,25, walking (only level 0 hides the party), the flag still set.
# Walking back out through loc_28546, LevelScreen parks the scooter on the
# arrival cell and the party is riding again.
#
# (build 129a) The note's quotes are one glyph each since 129a, not two,
# so its text finishes sooner and the ride's random numbers moved: the
# first encounter comes on the second step left from 85,107 (the scooter
# parked at 84,107, as before on the cell the step left), and a second one
# on the way up at 81,84.
#
# Before build 64, slot 0 on Motavia was a free entry: A found nothing,
# "There seems to be nothing unusual here." ($1708), and no scooter.

start slot 1 routes/saves/jet_scooter.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 89 116
shot 01_parked
press up                     # the scooter's box stops the step; he turns
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1686          # the note, first boarding only
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $171C          # "Let's get on the jet scooter!"
press c
wait idle                    # riding: the party hidden, the engine on
shot 02_riding
walk up 6
walk left 3
walk up 1
walk left 1
walk up 1
wait idle
walk left 1
wait idle
walk left 1                  # the step begins, and at once:
wait screen battle           # an encounter. On the scooter the roll comes
                             # on the step's first frame, while the
                             # leader's copy is still on the cell it
                             # leaves (loc_11700); BattleScreen saves that
                             # cell, so the step never happens
wait idle                    # FIGHT / STGY
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level            # LevelScreen parks the scooter where the
wait idle                    # fight began; the party is riding again
expect level 0 84 107
shot 03_back_on_the_scooter
walk left 3
walk up 24                   # and on the 24th step's first frame
wait screen battle           # (build 129a) another encounter, at 81,84
wait idle
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 81 84         # parked where that fight began, riding
walk up 3                    # 2 steps, then the push into the entrance
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level $29 47 25
shot 04_red_dam_f1
expect no-stderr not ported
expect no-stderr jet scooter
walk down 4                  # out the way we came: loc_28546, back to 81,82
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 0 81 82         # on the scooter, parked on the arrival cell
shot 05_out_riding
press a                      # nothing ahead: ObjType_Events 0 (loc_D9AA)
wait idle
expect script $171E          # "We can't get off here!": the scooter faces
shot 06_cant_get_off         # left, as LoadSpritesInLevel puts it, over water
press c
wait idle
wait ticks 2                 # the leader's copy held the offset while the
expect level 0 81 82         # box was up (loc_4B18 copies nothing); the
expect no-stderr not ported  # scooter's next frame at rest puts it back
